我陪着就是。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"03:33","timestamp":1795116801827,"roundId":"round_1795116777595_2sud80e8x","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":6997},{"id":1795158208222,"text":"哥哥，好喜欢这首歌的前面歌词","sender":"me","type":"text","time":"04:15","timestamp":1795119349390,"ltChat":true,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":6998},{"id":1795158208223,"text":"哪句？“你存在我深深的脑海里”那句么。","sender":"them","type":"text","time":"04:16","timestamp":1795119361058,"ltChat":true,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":6999},{"id":1795158208224,"text":"这么喜欢，是不是在拐弯抹角提醒我，某人平时也把位子占得满满的。","sender":"them","type":"text","time":"04:16","timestamp":1795119361059,"ltChat":true,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":7000},{"id":1795158208225,"text":"行了，歌词听到了，把眼睛闭上，听着这曲子该酝酿睡意了。","sender":"them","type":"text","time":"04:16","timestamp":1795119361060,"ltChat":true,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":7001},{"id":1795158208226,"text":"哥哥，我不喜欢你一直说“行了”","sender":"me","time":"04:18","timestamp":1795119485488,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":7002},{"id":1795158208227,"text":"😢","sender":"me","time":"04:18","timestamp":1795119488316,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":7003},{"id":1795158208228,"text":"你老是说这句，我感觉一直在否定我","sender":"me","time":"04:18","timestamp":1795119501317,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1784620258298_67y05ikff","characterId":"1aea6238-a795-4052-84a3-f11c9768f6a9","_id":7004},{"id":1795158208229,"text":"现在看到这两个字我就不想聊天了","sender":"me","time":"04:18","timestamp":1795119508056,"replyTo"